{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39548","headline":"和友人许裳题宣平里古藤 · 张蠙","name":"和友人许裳题宣平里古藤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲结千年茂，生来便近松。\n迸根通井润，交叶覆庭穠。\n历代频更主，盘空渐变龙。\n昼风圆影乱，宵雨细声重。\n盖密胜丹桂，层危类远峰。\n嫩条悬野鼠，枯节呌秋蛩。\n翠老霜难蚀，皴多藓乍封。\n几家遥共翫，何寺不堪容。\n客对忘离榻，僧看误过钟。\n顷因陪预作，终夕遶枝筇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张蠙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39548.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39548","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}